Rust dependencies
-----------------

VisionOTG uses third-party Rust crates listed in Cargo.toml and resolved in
Cargo.lock. Their individual license terms are available from crates.io and
the corresponding upstream repositories. The dependency graph can include
multiple licenses, so this file intentionally does not summarize it as one
license.

To inspect the resolved dependency licenses on a development machine, install
cargo-about and run:

	cargo about generate about.hbs > target/third-party-licenses.html

The generated report should accompany any distribution that requires a full
Rust dependency notice bundle.

Packaging responsibility
------------------------

The packager is responsible for preserving the license and notice files of
downloaded or system-provided runtime components. Verify the exact versions
used by packaging/windows/download_runtime.ps1 and packaging/linux/build.sh
when preparing a release.
